<title>USA: BFGoodrich completes sale of Ky. facilities.</title>
<headline>BFGoodrich completes sale of Ky. facilities.</headline>
<dateline>RICHFIELD, Ohio 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>BFGoodrich Co said it has completed the sale of its chlor-alkali and olefins facilities to The Westlake Group.</p>
<p>Terms for the Calvert City, Ky., facilities were not disclosed. These chlor-alkali and olefins operations produce ethylene, propylene, chlorine and caustic soda.</p>
<p>The Westlake Group, which is based in Houston, is a manufacturer and supplier of petrochemicals and plastics.</p>
<p>BFGoodrich provides aircraft systems and services and manufactures specialty chemicals.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
